        "TileImage": "$($repository 7271eae1-6bdd-4936-b763-b2390fb07fe7).Image",
        "Description": "Agent, this contract was ordered by a resident of Whittleton Creek who is not so fond of parties, hence why they want you to bring an end to the party by eliminating the host and hostess and the muffin man. They have also asked us to eliminate the plumber in the house that is for sale, so that the plumbing cant get fixed and the house won&apos;t get sold. Oh before i forget, the client wants everything to look like an accident. Good luck, Agent!",
